 consideration.\n\nhttps://lit.link/makairiri", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiraba__/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2213336, "client_id": 2971302, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0178ac827f3eae0a4e801053571c8d44", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0178ac827f3eae0a4e801053571c8d44, https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba60c23ef4a404b16fc1726041adeb45 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a881119a28ed3cc30f592945d6ff2ddb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14836b5f8f4f8946816c7e8b8e80abf1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14836b5f8f4f8946816c7e8b8e80abf1, https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba31952d458d1a3d49d474ab39dc33f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c9ae680a/uploads/origins/aee3bcf6-d935-4ed5-ac7f-7e5723af01d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e38fff84109d8b8117872c96183b8e07 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! My name is Mea Ameena and I am a personal Vtuber.\n\nI saw your illustration on X and was attracted by your beautiful design, so I decided to commission you.\n\nI would like to use it for my ASMR delivery, so I would be happy if the pose is lying on the bed (supine) with a bear cushion or stuffed animal in her arms.\nAlso, since he is a devil, we would like him to have a devil tail.\n\nSize\nWe would like to use the image for delivery and thumbnails, so please use 16:9 size.\n\nClothing\nBabydoll Dress\n\nData\nI would appreciate it if you could give me a PSD file for the person and the background, and also a transparent png file as I would like to use it for various purposes.\n\nSee X for the candy name Mea below.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/amenamea0214", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiraba__/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2213336, "client_id": 3078115, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=743f5f80c708ac5de6f37167ca6fa291", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=743f5f80c708ac5de6f37167ca6fa291, https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcb6eb556e0a09fd66a7e65b24275dea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cb83930fc70b8af6ec2514c88d000fb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf62e0d685ba1704827e620332933ee4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf62e0d685ba1704827e620332933ee4, https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1b9fa84a9bfc9f6bd202f2391a2f4608 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6cd073dc/uploads/origins/b24cdd96-358d-4f72-93dc-b1815e61d964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c3b37dc3e84833eb8207d357380a0e7 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!  I was attracted by your wonderful illustrations on X and I would like to send a request for a Tadpole-sama illustration for a Vtuber (Lirika Kanzaki) whom I support.\nI would like to request an illustration for Valentine's Day on February 14.\nThis is my first time to request a sketchbook, so I apologize if there is anything I have not done well!\n\nAbout the illustration\nI would like an illustration for Valentine's Day.\nI will leave the composition and pose to you. I would like an illustration that depicts the whole body as much as possible.\nPlease use a sweater or knit type of clothing.\nPlease make sure that the left and right sides of the head and hair are not visible from the canvas.\nReference materials\nSNS of the person in question\nhttps://x.com/kanzaki_ririka?s=21&t=dJZfCqwI5jpm3HC5G1Faew\nFanbox\nhttps://lit.link/LyricalRirika\nPlease give the hair style of this distribution. ⬇️\n... https://www.youtube.com/live/5_ayK3x2AnI?si=b5TWcgH4Erj16Xk0\n\n[Regarding the use of the information.\nThe Vtuber himself/herself is expected to use it for the following purposes.\nPosting on SNS (mainly Twitter)\nUse as a thumbnail for video distribution\nUse of the image on goods and other items used in the course of activities.\nFree distribution of member-only wallpaper\n\n About the delivery format\nIf possible, we would be happy to receive PSD data (with background transparency differences)! Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@shiraba__/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2213336, "client_id": 2316137, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acefbcb3a417d1025b9e4559149ab963", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acefbcb3a417d1025b9e4559149ab963, https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b265ead45aa41ac556068bc4d3c5f56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cdf8d359b13becec0830c68621f7fd6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f904c6bd0bc55934f82d11c2b6fd053d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origins/9c2e98d5-9d68-433d-bdfe-8ff87547c8c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f904c6bd0bc55934f82d11c2b6fd053d, https://si.imgix.net/c45faebd/uploads/origi